url: https://github.com/RichP0123/erdos993-floor38/releases/tag/v0.1.0-floor38
abstract: Lean-checked unimodality of the independence sequence for every finite simple forest with
  at most 37 vertices. The full proof and concrete Mathlib corollary use a reviewed custom kernel-assembly
  and reimport workflow. A separate 116-module general library passed an ordinary Lake build. A fresh
  full exported-source rebuild and conventional full final-source elaboration have not been completed.
  The original-contribution license and third-party exceptions are detailed in LICENSE_SCOPE.md.
  This is a finite result, not a proof of unrestricted Erdos 993.
